{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "2a7fa059-f392-8d5a-b9ad-61721dd5dcca",
  "created_at": "2026-01-27T10:54:33-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Jorge Raposo",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:48:30-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:48:35-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hi. I'm calling about water in my cellar. It came up from the storm drain situation out front, I'm pretty sure, and I want somebody to come look at it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:48:49-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, sorry to hear that. Let me grab a few details. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:48:56-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "433 Broadway. Up the North End."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:49:00-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "433 Broadway, North End. Got it. And when did this happen?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:49:06-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Over the weekend, that snow-to-rain storm, Sunday into Monday. It snowed all Sunday, then it turned to rain overnight and by Monday morning I had water coming in the cellar. A few inches. [pause] First time that's happened since I bought the house, and I've been here years."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:49:28-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A few inches, okay. So first time ever down there. Let me write that down. Was it coming up through a floor drain, or in through the walls, or do you know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:49:43-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Seeped in along the wall, near the front. And the drain at the curb was totally blocked up. Slush, leaves, all of it packed in there. As I said, the water was just sitting at the curb, it wasn't going anywhere."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:50:02-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, so the catch basin out front was clogged with slush and debris, and the water had nowhere to go. Is it still backed up today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:50:14-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's down some, but it's still a puddle out there. And I'm not going to wait for the next storm. It was not this bad last winter, I'll tell you that. Last winter I had a little puddle in the street and that was it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:50:35-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's a big difference. Okay, I'm putting down: catch basin at 433 Broadway, blocked, standing water, and it's gone into the cellar. Is anybody hurt, any electrical down there, the furnace, anything like that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:50:51-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Furnace is on the other side, it's fine. I got a wet vac going. I just want the drain cleared. [sighs] I shouldn't have to call about this."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:51:04-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, understood. I'll put in a work order for the crew to go out and clear that basin. After a storm like this they've got a long list, a lot of drains in town are in the same shape."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:51:22-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, well, that's what I figured. Do the crews work weekends? Because if it's going to be Saturday before anyone shows up, I need to know, I'll be out there with a shovel myself."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:51:38-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "They do get called in on weekends when it's bad, but for a drain like this, I'd expect them to get to it during the week. I'd say the next day or two is realistic, though it depends how the list goes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:51:57-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A day or two. Okay. And if it rains again before that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:52:03-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Then call back right away and I'll flag it as a repeat on the same ticket so it gets bumped. Is the best number for you the one you're calling from?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:52:17-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, it's 401-555-0174."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:52:19-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0174. Good. And it's Mr.... how do you spell the last name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:52:25-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Raposo. R-A-P-O-S-O. Jorge."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:52:27-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Jorge Raposo. Perfect. Now, one thing, if you're seeing any cracks or the water keeps coming in even when it's dry out, that's a different issue from the drain, and you'd want a plumber or somebody to look at the foundation. But the drain, that's ours."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:52:48-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, it's just from the storm. Dry now. I'm just saying, the whole block's been dealing with the same slush. The neighbors are all complaining. We've actually got a potluck planned on the block this month and everybody's going to be talking about this drain."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:53:08-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[laughs] Well, let's get it cleared before then so you've got something better to talk about. Anyone else on the block having water in their cellar, or just you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:53:22-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Next door says some water in the yard, not inside. I think I'm the low spot."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:53:30-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that helps. I'll note that you're at the low point and the neighbor has yard flooding. That way the crew checks the basins on both sides."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:53:43-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. Good. Do I get a call when they're done?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:53:48-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll note it for a call back to that number. Might be the crew lead, might be the office, but somebody should let you know."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:54:00-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. I'll wait till Thursday and if nothing happens I'm calling again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:54:06-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fair, and give them the ticket reference if I can. Hold on, let me get that... I've got it written up under your name and 433 Broadway, so just say that and we'll pull it up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:54:23-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:54:25-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You bet, Mr. Raposo. Good luck with the cleanup. Take care."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:54:31-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep. Bye."
    }
  ],
